                "type": "string"
            },
            "message": {
            "description": "### Error Cases\n\n#### Case 1: Failed to download file from `input_url`\n**Message:** “Failed to download file from the input url”\n\n#### Case 2: OCR model failed to run  \n**Message:** “The call to OCR failed to run”\n\n#### Case 3: Failed to realign pages after OCR call  \nWhich may include other OCR calls.  \n**Message:** “Failed to realign pages due to subsequent OCR calls, or post processing errors”\n\n#### Case 4: Document Splitter model failed to run  \nIncludes one retry if needed.  \n**Message:** “The call to Document Splitter Model failed to run”\n\n#### Case 5: Catchall error for cases not covered above  \n**Message:** “Post processing error”",
            "type": "string"
            },
            "splitting_method": {
                "description": "Splitting method: `None`, `Document`, or `Patient`.",
                "type": "string"
            },
